  "notes": [
    "No release before 0.5.0 may claim any of this is balanced: every magnitude in the shipped content carries tuningStatus untuned and the balance harness owns all of them -- so this file is a measurement and not a balance claim.",
    "The universe is still degenerate in the following ways, and this edit closes none of them. Nothing in packages/scenario opens a portal, so no raid runs in any committed sweep and no summon is ever created. Scribing still stops when the materials stock empties. knowledgeKind has no consumer in the rules path.",
    "This gate is the only committed one that plays a god verb at all: the other two run passive-control fixed, which submits an empty preference list and therefore no intervention. balance/README.md records what it would take to close that, and the measured cost of doing so."
  ],
